{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_48","type":"agent_message","text":"代码已写入 [1.py](/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/seed262781723/7/1.py)。\n\n`main()` 现在按矩形边界条件识别带缺口的框，不依赖“边框必须连通”这个错误前提，所以能处理多边同时开口的情况。`generate_input()` 会随机化网格尺寸、框数量、框尺寸、位置、缺口组合、缺口位置、标记数量和是否发生边界截断，并保证四个方向在单个样例里都有覆盖。\n\n已执行并通过自检：\n```bash\npython - <<'PY'\nfrom importlib.machinery import SourceFileLoader\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport hashlib\nimport numpy as np\n\np = Path(\"/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/seed262781723/7/1.py\")\nmod = SourceFileLoader(\"new_arc_task\", str(p)).load_module()\nsigs = set()\nfor i in range(100):\n    inp = mod.generate_input()\n    out = mod.main(inp)\n    assert isinstance(inp, np.ndarray)\n    assert isinstance(out, np.ndarray)\n    assert inp.ndim == 2 and max(inp.shape) <= 30, f\"input grid exceeds 30x30: {inp.shape}\"\n    assert out.ndim == 2 and max(out.shape) <= 30, f\"output grid exceeds 30x30: {out.shape}\"\n    sigs.add(hashlib.md5(inp.tobytes() + str(inp.shape).encode()).hexdigest())\nprint(\"variants\", len(sigs))\nassert len(sigs) >= 20\nPY\npython -m py_compile \"/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/seed262781723/7/1.py\"\n```\n\n结果是 `variants 100`，并且已清理验证产生的 `__pycache__`。"}}
